type: software
title: "Kalshi Order Book Dashboard"
abstract: "A live order book service for Kalshi prediction markets. One Python process keeps order books in memory from Kalshi's WebSocket feed, repairs lost updates from a snapshot, and pushes changes to browsers. The repository includes the measured latency, CPU and capacity figures behind its design."
